--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files in this package derived from the upstream sources, and modified
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/src/event_emitter.dart
    The synchronous listener semantics follow the EventEmitter the upstream
    project uses (a listener list dispatched in order, `once`, and an
    `emit` that reports whether anybody was listening). Modified: bridged to
    Dart broadcast streams, which register the underlying listener only
    while the stream has subscribers.

lib/src/types.dart, lib/src/transport_types.dart, lib/src/errors.dart
    Independent Dart implementations. The error taxonomy and the wire
    envelope shapes follow the upstream protocol.
